      "section": "Section 8.14; Section 10.3",
      "quote": null,
      "summary": "Designating an unrestricted subsidiary counts as an Investment and must fit an investment basket. The dedicated basket for Foreign and Unrestricted Subsidiaries is $75M, but Section 10.3(k) allows unlimited other Investments if there is no default and pro forma covenant compliance, so there is no hard cap.",
      "quote_verified": null
